    "publisher": "Same binary: full JSON encoding/free versus production sparse prepare/encode/acknowledged commit/free. One changed group, no volatile samples; nine samples. Prior baseline is preconstructed. This fixture excludes HTTP/replication. At 10,000 groups the full JSON fixture exceeds the default 32 MiB HTTP limit; this is an encoding benchmark, not a successful 10,000-group bootstrap.",
