    "snapshot": "Same source snapshot: deep clone/read/free versus immutable lease capture/read/release. Both paths consume one runtime payload per store. Nine samples; shared views batch 1,000 iterations per timer reading for clock resolution. This excludes the reconciliation plan itself.",
    "application": "Unpaired three-metadata/three-data-node relational catalog workload: 100 one-shard tables, desired data replica count 1. Setup and readiness measured separately. Three clients sustain batches of 100 full-index upserts, qualified searches and catalog discovery for 30 seconds; every response validated."
